00:36:56,743 --> 00:36:57,363
[SPEAKER_02]: But yeah, so...

368
00:36:59,528 --> 00:37:06,512
[SPEAKER_02]: Recollection and awareness as well, that's an aspect of the Noble Eightfold Path already.

369
00:37:07,532 --> 00:37:13,215
[SPEAKER_02]: So, yeah, technically, by that point, ideally, a person should have the right view.

370
00:37:13,235 --> 00:37:21,200
