371
00:37:22,080 --> 00:37:40,948
[SPEAKER_02]: So, that's when, again, you would end up paying attention to these tiny things that are very secondary, like your sensations in your knees and stuff, but really it's intentions of passion, aversion and distraction on the very most subtle level that you would have to be aware of.

372
00:37:43,389 --> 00:37:48,732
[SPEAKER_02]: Like, you know, doing bodily movements because you're concerned about what other people think about you or something.

373
00:37:49,332 --> 00:38:06,215
[SPEAKER_02]: Which could, I mean, it could be on a wholesome level, like, you know, monks trying to be super... exaggerate, almost, their demeanor and their conduct, so as to gain appreciation and respect.

