00:38:06,956 --> 00:38:08,636
[SPEAKER_02]: It could extend to things like that.

375
00:38:08,736 --> 00:38:12,877
[SPEAKER_02]: So, every little thing you do, then you're aware why you're doing it, but...

376
00:38:13,761 --> 00:38:35,435
[SPEAKER_02]: See, if you haven't been developing these things and you start with that, even if you have the right instruction that it should be about unwholesome intentions and not about watching sensations in your body, you could still then become almost like neurotic, watching every little thing you do, and you would be actually overlooking then a way more

