00:40:52,645 --> 00:40:54,285
[SPEAKER_02]: There's nothing immoral about entertainment.

399
00:40:54,466 --> 00:40:56,987
[SPEAKER_02]: There's nothing immoral about eating in the afternoon.

400
00:40:57,007 --> 00:40:59,548
[SPEAKER_02]: There's nothing immoral about sleeping in high and luxurious beds.

401
00:41:00,429 --> 00:41:06,952
[SPEAKER_02]: Now, it's about yourself and your... From that point onwards, it's about yourself and your relationship with your own mind.

