00:41:07,152 --> 00:41:08,353
[SPEAKER_02]: What will make this mind

403
00:41:09,445 --> 00:41:16,206
[SPEAKER_02]: more wild, more passionate, have more craving, and what will make it go in the opposite direction.

404
00:41:21,308 --> 00:41:32,290
[SPEAKER_00]: You could also, like, this example of, like, a monk or whoever, like, he's in a monastery or whatever, set up and try to micromanage his life in a way that

