406
00:41:39,786 --> 00:41:52,393
[SPEAKER_00]: Actually, it leads him quite in the... quite away from what he's supposed to do, because it's like... Yeah, again, wanting to, as you say, over-manage everything just because he's afraid.

407
00:41:53,467 --> 00:41:56,951
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, and another aspect of that is, if you go into micromanagement of these things, again, that's, like it says, having

