00:43:12,931 --> 00:43:16,752
[SPEAKER_00]: Like, it's kind of at the end of the week, or at the end of the ten days, or I don't know when, whatever.

415
00:43:17,762 --> 00:43:25,026
[SPEAKER_02]: Or you might even assume, no, as a result of the meditation, I'll be able to keep the precepts.

416
00:43:25,086 --> 00:43:26,427
