419
00:43:34,771 --> 00:43:40,654
[SPEAKER_02]: But the thing is, when there is craving that's being abandoned, it cannot feel good.

420
00:43:42,555 --> 00:43:44,476
[SPEAKER_02]: The mind is going to be rebelling against that.

421
00:43:44,496 --> 00:43:46,297
[SPEAKER_02]: And then, if it doesn't feel

422
00:43:47,257 --> 00:43:52,725
[SPEAKER_02]: At least some amount of... not necessarily like torture, but some amount of dissonance there.

423
00:43:53,907 --> 00:43:56,691
