00:44:22,292 --> 00:44:23,413
[SPEAKER_02]: So, so it's like,

429
00:44:25,522 --> 00:44:26,643
[SPEAKER_02]: It's not the same thing anymore.

430
00:44:27,383 --> 00:44:29,984
[SPEAKER_02]: You're not abandoning the same thing anymore.

431
00:44:30,224 --> 00:44:33,506
[SPEAKER_02]: It's like you change it into something else, and now you're abandoning it.

432
00:44:34,586 --> 00:44:34,926
[SPEAKER_00]: So...

433
00:44:35,787 --> 00:44:44,150
[SPEAKER_00]: It's like trying to, kind of, make the dhamma fit with my ignorance, you know.

434
00:44:44,270 --> 00:44:51,714
