00:44:56,511 --> 00:45:09,302
[SPEAKER_02]: Each of these steps, like when you're fulfilling them, none of them would involve... all of them would involve the basic principle that we always talk about, endurance or patience, in regard to what is felt.

438
00:45:09,482 --> 00:45:11,544
[SPEAKER_02]: That is how you would cultivate each of them.

439
00:45:12,464 --> 00:45:19,790
[SPEAKER_02]: So, none of them would involve, yeah, managing feeling or trying to control feeling.

440
00:45:20,191 --> 00:45:22,072
[SPEAKER_02]: You would end up doing that if you

441
00:45:24,074 --> 00:45:26,676
[SPEAKER_02]: Try to skip to something that comes later.

442
00:45:27,416 --> 00:45:31,079
[SPEAKER_02]: But all of them would be basically the same principle.

