447
00:45:57,328 --> 00:46:02,711
[SPEAKER_01]: When the bhikkhu is possessed of recollection and awareness, the realized one guides him further.

448
00:46:02,771 --> 00:46:14,078
[SPEAKER_01]: Come bhikkhu, frequent a secluded lodging, a wilderness, the root of a tree, a hill, a ravine, a mountain cave, a charnel ground, a forest, the open air, a heap of straw.

