00:46:42,740 --> 00:46:48,522
[SPEAKER_01]: Compassionate for the welfare of all creatures, he cleanses the mind of aversion and hatred.

456
00:46:49,131 --> 00:46:54,153
[SPEAKER_01]: Giving up indolence and lethargy, he abides with the mind rid of indolence and lethargy.

