00:50:20,236 --> 00:50:24,639
[SPEAKER_02]: Oh, these objects are the hindrances.

481
00:50:25,539 --> 00:50:35,265
[SPEAKER_02]: And then, naturally, you would use meditation for the wrong purpose of basically not feeling things anymore, replacing one thing with the other.

482
00:50:36,226 --> 00:50:47,353
[SPEAKER_02]: And that's where you would be, again, by skipping all the all the previous stages, you would end up with something else that's not really

