484
00:51:12,655 --> 00:51:13,596
[SPEAKER_02]: You take it out of the woods,

485
00:51:15,815 --> 00:51:37,484
[SPEAKER_02]: Then, you gradually train it to the point where, even when it's being attacked on all sides by, you know, men with spears, and bows, and arrows, and sounds of drums, it doesn't quiver, it doesn't flinch, and it's fit to be a royal elephant.

486
00:51:37,684 --> 00:51:43,687
