539
00:57:17,420 --> 00:57:30,127
[SPEAKER_02]: Whether it's the recollection of past lives, or it's the understanding of kamma, how beings are reborn and stuff, or the most acute thing, which is the Four Noble Truths, you would be able to see it.

540
00:57:30,767 --> 00:57:31,548
[SPEAKER_02]: Like the Buddha would say,

541
00:57:34,129 --> 00:57:35,210
[SPEAKER_02]: Then, you have a clear pond.

542
00:57:35,490 --> 00:57:36,912
[SPEAKER_02]: I think we mentioned that similar last time.

543
00:57:36,932 --> 00:57:43,077
[SPEAKER_02]: Like a clear pond that's... that's... like the mud and stuff is not all over.

544
00:57:43,157 --> 00:57:45,419
[SPEAKER_02]: So, you can actually see what's inside.

545
00:57:45,880 --> 00:57:51,545
[SPEAKER_02]: Then, you would see, oh look, these are the fish swimming around, and these are the oysters, and this is this, and this is that.

546
00:57:52,265 --> 00:57:59,251
[SPEAKER_02]: All of that understanding would come as a result of the clear mind that is built through that gradual training.

547
00:58:00,312 --> 00:58:00,653
[SPEAKER_02]: So...

548
00:58:01,778 --> 00:58:30,335
[SPEAKER_02]: If a person doesn't have that understanding, that's really another way in which people would really be wasting effort that they could invest in a more productive way, like trying to directly create this understanding of anatta and anicca, and really try to go into it, and think that the answer will come at the end of some direct effort to get it.

549
00:58:30,375 --> 00:58:30,836
[SPEAKER_02]: But really,

550
00:58:31,896 --> 00:58:34,099
[SPEAKER_02]: If it's... these things are there on their own.

551
00:58:34,139 --> 00:58:36,643
[SPEAKER_02]: Like, you know, form is already impermanent.

552
00:58:37,604 --> 00:58:39,426
[SPEAKER_02]: It's... feeling is already impermanent.

553
00:58:39,646 --> 00:58:41,048
[SPEAKER_02]: Perceptions are already impermanent.

554
00:58:41,669 --> 00:58:46,335
[SPEAKER_02]: So, you just don't see it, because the mind hasn't been cleared of obstructions through this.

555
00:58:47,336 --> 00:58:53,219
[SPEAKER_02]: So, all of that would just fit into place if you purify your mind from the five hindrances.

556
00:58:53,239 --> 00:58:58,641
[SPEAKER_02]: You would say it's like a river that's blocked by...

557
00:58:59,741 --> 00:59:05,924
[SPEAKER_02]: I think it says like logs and debris and stuff, and the flow of the river is blocked.

558
00:59:06,384 --> 00:59:08,445
[SPEAKER_02]: But as soon as you remove it, it would just

559
00:59:10,273 --> 00:59:13,954
[SPEAKER_02]: So, it's the same of the five hindrances.

560
00:59:14,614 --> 00:59:26,078
[SPEAKER_02]: People don't realize superhuman states, don't realize higher wisdom, don't realize the nature of things because of these five hindrances.

561
00:59:26,818 --> 00:59:33,440
[SPEAKER_02]: All of those that you can't have, be free from five hindrances on a mental level,

562
00:59:34,283 --> 00:59:39,184
[SPEAKER_02]: While on a physical and verbal level, you still do the things that are motivated by the five hindrances.

563
00:59:40,325 --> 00:59:47,666
[SPEAKER_02]: It's said, in fact, that the five hindrances are nourished by misconduct of body, speech and mind.

564
00:59:48,407 --> 00:59:53,268
[SPEAKER_02]: So, again, just to repeat, that's why you can't start there.

565
00:59:58,572 --> 01:00:19,011
[SPEAKER_02]: In fact, if the connection between... like if it seems like I can still abandon the five hindrances, but sort of on the side keep doing these things, that's... you should take that as a sign that, at least according to the Buddha's definition, that what you're abandoning there is not the five hindrances.

566
01:00:19,071 --> 01:00:21,333
[SPEAKER_00]: It's like one of the kind of

567
01:00:22,624 --> 01:00:26,385
[SPEAKER_00]: It's a common view that contemporary teachers can teach often.

568
01:00:26,765 --> 01:00:30,087
[SPEAKER_00]: It's like the historical dimension and then the ultimate dimension.

569
01:00:30,827 --> 01:00:37,369
[SPEAKER_00]: So, like, you know, like these two, like, kind of separate realms that are... Or conventional reality and ultimate reality.

570
01:00:37,389 --> 01:00:39,090
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, exactly, like, that don't have connection.

571
01:00:39,150 --> 01:00:44,792
[SPEAKER_00]: So, like, I think it's one of the things is that, yeah, I'm doing my two hours contemplation of...

572
01:00:45,907 --> 01:00:49,128
[SPEAKER_00]: And you would even think, sometimes, that's how warped it gets.

573
01:00:49,148 --> 01:00:52,069
[SPEAKER_00]: Like, you would think, oh, but you're not supposed to be attached.

574
01:00:52,089 --> 01:00:53,829
[SPEAKER_00]: So, why are you getting attached to the to the precepts and stuff?

575
01:00:53,849 --> 01:00:55,150
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes, you do have to abandon it.

576
01:00:55,230 --> 01:00:57,591
[SPEAKER_00]: It says, sīla bhaṭṭhaparamāsa, and all these

